      "text": "9 October saw culinary duo Clarissa Dickson Wright and Jennifer Paterson roar onto **BBC Two** with the debut of *Two Fat Ladies*. Riding a 1930s-style Triumph Thunderbird motorcycle with a Watsonian sidecar, the eccentric cooks traversed the British countryside preparing lavish meals packed with lard, double cream, and unrepentant quantities of **butter**. The show was an immediate smash hit, offering an anarchic rebuke to contemporary healthy eating advice with hearty laughter and liberal splashes of alcohol.",
