      "text": "3 May saw **Arsenal** seal the Premier League title in magnificent style by routing Everton 4–0 at Highbury. The crowning moment arrived when reformed captain **Tony Adams** galloped through the Toffees' backline to half-volley a majestic fourth goal into the North Bank net, cementing French manager Arsène Wenger's historic debut league title. Sceptical football columnists who had famously greeted the Frenchman's 1996 appointment with the headline \"Arsène Who?\" discreetly recycled their old back-page columns.",
